      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_04",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "제가 하고 싶은 것, 먹고 싶은 것이 생길 때마다 아낌없이 도와주셨죠.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "わたしが食べたいもの、したいことがあると、惜しみなく力を貸してくれました。",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "每當我想做什麼、想吃什麼的時候，她們都會毫不吝嗇地幫助我。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_04_DRUID_23.ogg"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 64,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAGICIAN_DRUID_04",
      "WaitClick": true,
