      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그때마다 <color=#F7BE45>로로카</color>라고 하셨어요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そしてその度に、<color=#F7BE45>ロロカ</color>と言っていたんです。",
      "UnitTalk_TWN": "每次她們都說<color=#F7BE45>洛洛卡</color>。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_04_DRUID_24.ogg"
    },
    {
