      "UnitTalk_TWN": "他帶著從鄉下來什麼都不懂的我遊覽城市。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "JOURNEY_1021_JOURNEY_04_DRUID_30.ogg"
    },
    {
